    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">Safety, without the noise.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_body">ResQLink keeps your trusted contacts, emergency profile, and incident history available on this device—even when the network is not.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_offline_title">Ready when signals aren’t.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_offline_body">Emergency events are saved locally first. Connectivity and location are helpful layers, never blockers.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_privacy_title">You stay in control.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_privacy_body">After you confirm SOS, ResQLink asks for permission to send an emergency message and call your primary trusted contact. That message contains your saved emergency profile and your last known location. Everything stays on this device.</string>
